[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Endpoint management
UID: APP-END
VERSION: 1.0.0
DATE: 2026-09-30
CLASSIFICATION: Internal
PREFIX: END-
ROOT: False

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: ../../grammar/org.sgra

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: Enrollment, patch compliance, media control, and lost-device response for managed endpoints.

[[SECTION]]
UID: END-SEC-ENR
PREFIX: ENR
TITLE: Enrollment

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: END-ENR-001
TITLE: Corporate device
STATEMENT: Endpoint shall enroll a device before it is allowed to open enterprise data.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-END-001
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-CFG-004
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AC-19
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: CM-8

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: END-ENR-002
TITLE: Owner
STATEMENT: Endpoint shall record the person a device is assigned to.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-END-001
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-ID-008
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: CM-8
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: IA-4

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: END-ENR-003
TITLE: Unenrolled block
STATEMENT: Endpoint shall block a device that is not enrolled from the enterprise network profile.
STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-END-001
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-CFG-003
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AC-3
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: CM-7
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: V-222399

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: END-ENR-004
TITLE: Certificate
STATEMENT: Endpoint shall install a device certificate from the enterprise authority.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-END-001
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-CRY-005
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: SC-17
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: IA-3

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: END-ENR-005
TITLE: Retire
STATEMENT: Endpoint shall wipe enterprise data when a device is retired.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-END-004
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-ID-004
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: MP-6

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: END-ENR-006
TITLE: Lost
STATEMENT: Endpoint shall lock a reported-lost device and wipe it if it does not check in.
STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-END-004
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-MON-008
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: MP-6
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: IR-4
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: V-222400
[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: END-SEC-PAT
PREFIX: CMP
TITLE: Compliance

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: END-CMP-001
TITLE: Patch level
STATEMENT: Endpoint shall mark a device non-compliant when a critical patch is missing past the window.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-END-002
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-MON-002
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: SI-2
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: RA-5
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: V-222403

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: END-CMP-002
TITLE: Disk encryption
STATEMENT: Endpoint shall require disk encryption before a device is compliant.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-END-001
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-CRY-002
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: SC-28

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: END-CMP-003
TITLE: Screen lock
STATEMENT: Endpoint shall require a screen lock within the configured idle time.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-ID-006
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-ID-006
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AC-11

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: END-CMP-004
TITLE: Malware agent
STATEMENT: Endpoint shall require the malware agent to be running and current.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-END-001
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-MON-003
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: SI-3

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: END-CMP-005
TITLE: Media block
STATEMENT: Endpoint shall block removable storage unless an exception names the device and the expiry.
STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-END-003
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-CFG-003
