  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: V-222404

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: END-CMP-006
TITLE: Exception review
STATEMENT: Endpoint shall expire a media exception and list it for review.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-END-003
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-CFG-002
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: CM-3

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: END-CMP-007
TITLE: Drift report
STATEMENT: Endpoint shall report a device whose configuration has left the baseline.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-END-002
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
